                <head>224. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>During a fifteen-minute meeting on September 24, 1972, President Nixon and Henry
                        Kissinger discussed the situation in Uganda and also devoted some
                    attention to Burundi. For a transcript of the conversation, see <ref
                        target="#d258">Document 258</ref>.</p>
            </div>
